{
  "schema": "yoyo.swplan/1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "齿轮轴（gear_shaft，轴身回转 + 渐开线齿廓**切除** m=2 z=18）",
    "units": "mm",
    "note": "★ **模数来自 `meta.gear_train.module` = 2**（两齿轮模数必须相同）。齿部按 z₁=18 重新设计（消除根切）；⚠ **简化 3 项见 `_simplified` 与 open_questions Q8**（5 段锥面不建 / 螺纹不建 / 退刀收成直角）⇒ **不对账参照件总长**",
    "source_params": "assets/reducer/reducer.params.json"
  },
  "params": {},
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "n",
      "op": "new_part"
    },
    {
      "id": "p",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "Front",
      "note": "轴向 = X（Front 平面的 x）；草图坐标 (x,y) = (轴向, 半径)"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "op": "sketch_begin"
    },
    {
      "id": "prof",
      "op": "shaft_profile",
      "segments": [
        {
          "d": 20.0,
          "l": 16.0,
          "name": "输出端轴"
        },
        {
          "d": 18.0,
          "l": 3.0,
          "name": "退刀槽"
        },
        {
          "d": 24.0,
          "l": 8.0,
          "name": "齿根侧台阶"
        },
        {
          "d": 24.0,
          "l": 25.196,
          "name": "★齿部轴段"
        },
        {
          "d": 24.0,
          "l": 8.0,
          "name": "齿根对侧台阶"
        },
        {
          "d": 18.0,
          "l": 3.0,
          "name": "退刀槽对侧"
        },
        {
          "d": 20.0,
          "l": 15.0,
          "name": "轴身"
        },
        {
          "d": 18.0,
          "l": 16.0,
          "name": "轴承位"
        },
        {
          "d": 11.0,
          "l": 4.0,
          "name": "端部"
        },
        {
          "d": 14.0,
          "l": 9.047,
          "name": "端部螺纹（建光杆）"
        }
      ],
      "end_chamfer": 2.0,
      "note": "★ 段表来自 params.shaft_segments。Σl=107.243 + 两端 45° 倒角 2×2 = 总长 111.243。★ **齿部那一段是细轴 Ø24**（x=29→54.196），**齿根/齿顶由后面的齿廓拉伸成形**，不是这里建柱面"
    },
    {
      "id": "zf0",
      "op": "zoom_fit"
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "轴半剖面"
    },
    {
      "id": "cksk",
      "op": "check_sketch",
      "sketch": "轴半剖面"
    },
    {
      "id": "ck1",
      "op": "check_sketch_constraint",
      "sketch": "轴半剖面",
      "expect_min_dims": 0,
      "note": "★ 标注已封存 ⇒ 只记录约束状态"
    },
    {
      "id": "rev",
      "op": "revolve_boss",
      "name": "轴体",
      "angle": 360
    },
    {
      "id": "po",
      "op": "plane_offset",
      "base": "Right",
      "offset": 29.0,
      "name": "齿部面",
      "note": "★ 齿廓草图面 = Right 沿 +X 偏 **x=29**（齿部轴段起点）"
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "op": "select_plane",
      "plane": "齿部面",
      "note": "齿廓平面 ⊥ 轴（法向 X）"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "op": "sketch_begin",
      "reset": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cl",
      "op": "centerline",
      "x1": -25.196,
      "y1": 0.0,
      "x2": 25.196,
      "y2": 0.0,
      "note": "齿宽方向中心线（构造线；S7 锚定 + 齿宽参考）"
    },
    {
      "id": "gear",
      "op": "gear_profile",
      "mn": 2.0,
      "z": 18,
      "beta": 0.0,
      "alpha_n": 20.0,
      "x": 0.0,
      "mode": "polyline",
      "n_flank": 6,
      "n_root": 2,
      "n_tip": 3,
      "note": "整圈渐开线（m=2 取自 meta.gear_train，z=18）。★ 这里**拉伸成实体**（不是切除）：齿根圆 Ø31 与齿顶 Ø40 由齿廓实体自然形成"
    },
    {
      "id": "zf1",
      "op": "zoom_fit"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "op": "sketch_end",
      "name": "齿廓"
    },
    {
      "id": "ck2",
      "op": "check_sketch_constraint",
      "sketch": "齿廓",
      "expect_min_dims": 0,
      "note": "★ 标注已封存"
    },
    {
      "id": "boss2",
      "op": "extrude_boss",
      "depth": 20.0,
      "end_cond": "swEndCondBlind",
      "merge": true,
      "name": "齿部",
      "note": "★ **拉伸成实体并 merge**（不是切除！齿顶 Ø40 圆柱由这里建出）。齿宽 20，从齿部面 x=29 向 +X ⇒ 齿占 x 29→49；齿部轴段全长 25.196 ⇒ 两端各留退刀 2.598mm"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb",
      "op": "check_bbox",
      "expect": [
        111.243,
        40.0,
        40.0
      ],
      "tol": 0.2,
      "note": "**齿顶方向** = da = m(z+2) = 40（★ 渐开线面不是圆柱面，只能这样判）；轴向 111.243 = 简化后的总长（**参照件是 158.241，差 47mm = 5 段锥面不建，见 Q8**，不与参照件比）"
    },
    {
      "id": "cyl",
      "op": "check_cyl_radius",
      "expect_max": 12.0,
      "tol": 0.05,
      "note": "最大**圆柱面** = 轴台阶 Ø24/2 = 12。★ 齿根 Ø31 与齿顶 Ø40 **都不是圆柱面**（渐开线齿廓），只能由 `check_bbox` 判（§89）。本判据钉住轴各段直径没建错"
    },
    {
      "id": "m",
      "op": "check_mass",
      "expect_mass_g": 47.015,
      "tol": 0.02,
      "note": "**47.015g 是真机标定值**：齿隙体积取决于 gear_profile 采样密度，解析式算不出 18 个齿隙挖掉多少。**齿数重新设计后旧标定值作废**，用 `--calibrate` 重取。"
    },
    {
      "id": "fc",
      "op": "check_feature_count",
      "min": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "diag",
      "op": "check_diagnostics",
      "fail_on": "error",
      "note": "齿顶变尖/根切等 error 级诊断（z=18, x=0.0）"
    },
    {
      "id": "sv",
      "op": "save_as",
      "path": "{{ params.out }}/23-gear_shaft-m2z18x40.SLDPRT",
      "overwrite": true
    }
  ],
  "_derived": {
    "m": 2.0,
    "z": 18,
    "alpha_n": 20.0,
    "x": 0.0,
    "da": 40.0,
    "df": 31.0,
    "face_width": 20.0,
    "n_segments": 10,
    "sum_l": 107.243,
    "total_len": 111.243,
    "end_chamfer": 2.0,
    "root_seg_x": [
      29.0,
      54.196
    ],
    "expect_mass_g": 47.015,
    "simplified": [
      "cones_dropped",
      "root_runout_flat",
      "thread_not_built"
    ],
    "reference_bbox_mm": [
      158.241,
      33.794,
      33.922
    ],
    "reconcile": "**只对账齿顶方向（da）与齿根圆（df）**，不对账总长"
  }
}
